    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HexDeck takes a fast round based approach to tower defense gameplay with consistently changing boards and foes, over 100 towers, and 3 playable creatures each with a completely different tower pool.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918990/extras/1241176a99fbeb0f2b12e25981d06200.avif?t=1752551526\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Deck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character and expand your deck with more towers that synergize with each other. Use sleeves to enhance your best cards with all sorts of unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918990/extras/b7a47b0c881bbb1ce8cb9a8b828019dd.avif?t=1752551526\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight for your life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight  in 4 different biomes with their unique playstyle. Learn to defeat powerful bosses and complex enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918990/extras/bb2c463c9b85575cc3eccc27c0dc3ff7.avif?t=1752551526\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome all</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new towers, sleeves, and challenges to keep every run fresh and raise the difficulty for bigger rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918990/extras/854d65f73eed73624fab1232edd0abe8.avif?t=1752551526\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See everything</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect eyes, open doors, find treasure, meet strangers, reach freedom.\u00a0</p>",
